\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces The preference block. Cluster-robust standard errors in parentheses, clustered on the household. ``Restricted'' marks a coordinate held at a value by the specification, not an estimated zero; ``at bound'' marks an estimate at a box endpoint, whose interval is reported under the active-set convention in the appendix. The consumption weight is common within a population and enters as \(\beta _c\log (C/\lambda _c)\).}}{13}{table.6}\protected@file@percent }
