\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces Lorenz curves of money-metric well-being and of the priced disposable income it replaces, over the same households and the same weights. The two curves answer different questions about the same households; their Gini values are not two estimates of one quantity.}}{21}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
