\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {13}{\ignorespaces Attribution shares under six inequality indices. Each index keeps its own coalition values and its own allocation. Access exceeds earning opportunities for single adults under all six and the ordering reverses for couples under all six; the singles preference share changes sign outside the Gini.}}{26}{figure.caption.13}\protected@file@percent }
